WEBVTT

00:01.720 --> 00:03.200
I cannot say for certain.

00:10.960 --> 00:16.400
I care nothing for worldly dominion or northern campaigns—those are your concerns, not mine.

00:17.320 --> 00:25.200
Yet when you took me as your wife, you promised: once we return to the North, you would take me to pluck willows at Bashang, and walk among the blossoms of Yong'an.

00:25.440 --> 00:26.500
Very well.

00:27.160 --> 00:30.000
How about I write you a solemn pledge in black and white?

00:30.600 --> 00:36.800
I shall write: "Solemnly owed to my wife—a journey to pluck willows at Bashang, and to stroll through the blossoms of Yong'an."

00:40.360 --> 00:42.400
Do you know why I truly came to see you today?

00:42.880 --> 00:44.800
What is on your mind, my Lady?

00:46.440 --> 00:52.400
If you tarry out on the frontier for too long... I shall choose our child's name myself.

00:54.000 --> 00:55.200
What did you say...?

00:55.840 --> 00:59.800
I said... you are going to be a father.

01:07.160 --> 01:10.500
I will return as swiftly as I can. I give you my word.
